Title: Judge's X Word Puzzle No. 26
Author: B. B. Bushing
Date: 1927-10-15
Byline: Submitted by B. B. Bushing, Indianapolis, Ind. Judge pays $10 for each puzzle printed
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-10-15_93/page/n63/mode/1up
Puzzle-Number: 26
Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-10-22_93/page/n32/mode/1up


CARD#ABBEY#VERB
R#ROB#AIR#TAN#O
AT#EVERGREEN#HO
MEW#D#B#A#N#TOT
#EAR#TERNS#CAT#
A#L#M#RED#T#L#O
PELLET#L#BALKED
RAP#REVELER#AGO
